{"ai_route":{"actual_response_model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","ai_run_id":"airun_20261006152112_386da2d3","expected_response_model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","fallback_chain_id":"aifb_4ff99791254905b05cc3f47e","fallback_depth":0,"fallback_reason":"","model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","provider":"mtplx","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","route_base_url":"http://127.0.0.1:8002/v1","route_identity_hash":"c9480819205db8521fec70763515cf905334434da194fa8ae2172b40ab545075","route_profile_id":"independent_ai__mtplx_qwen38_local","thinking":"enabled"},"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006152112_386da2d3","chunk_index":4,"job_id":"mwjob_5f1bc3199964d95fa63f91f8","precondition_digest":"a152920577fe3f6cd0dd4d514ed3426624fe83e1be3d143cacd52d1c030f8204","project_id":"proj_user_a67458cd1359","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v10","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_a67458cd1359_6864fa993ade751f","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_a67458cd1359_971df35e6c782845","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_a67458cd1359_2095604cc7275e36","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_a67458cd1359_d98f967ce86d4d93"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006152112_386da2d3","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:revision:6","quote":"多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照加活性对照的II期设计；KZ-PHN902每日两次口服，三组（100mg、200mg、普瑞巴林活性对照），治疗8周。","quote_sha256":"5ebd13070034ff83511bddb08013d85e08018c543059862255b76021107cc93e","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","span_id":"es1"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:revision:6","quote":"安慰剂与普瑞巴林活性对照双对照；三组1:1:1，双盲双模拟。","quote_sha256":"e301afe88ba70cf93405c6cb75cc921683b2b37536680346cfb03f619c864233","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","span_id":"es2"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es1","es2"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":2},"gap_items":[],"heading":"总体设计","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照加活性对照的II期临床研究，采用平行组设计。共设三个治疗组：KZ-PHN902 100mg每日两次口服组、KZ-PHN902 200mg每日两次口服组和普瑞巴林活性对照组，三组按1:1:1比例随机分配。双盲通过双模拟技术实现，即KZ-PHN902组受试者同时接受KZ-PHN902活性片与普瑞巴林匹配安慰剂，普瑞巴林组受试者同时接受普瑞巴林活性片与KZ-PHN902匹配安慰剂，安慰剂组受试者接受两种匹配安慰剂，使各组给药外观和方案一致。双盲治疗期为8周。研究期间不设置自适应设计、样本量再估计、期中分析、安全审查委员会或独立数据监查委员会。","rationale":"设计要素（多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照加活性对照、平行组、三组1:1:1、双盲双模拟、8周治疗、无自适应/无DMC）均来自当前项目已确认研究事实。双模拟具体匹配方式（外观、给药方案）为基于双盲双模拟事实的合理展开，需医学经理确认描述粒度是否适当。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（总体设计）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（期中分析、样本量）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。","本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_a67458cd1359_6864fa993ade751f","section_number":"4.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:e7a844fdaed1bdb4491456b3","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:97a2bd7fcf7302"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006152112_386da2d3","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:revision:6","quote":"治疗政策策略：主要终点为第8周24h平均NRS自基线变化；急救对乙酰氨基酚不改变归属；脱落不替换按ITT入FAS。","quote_sha256":"30e99fdc225a2c7a125e968b39bdadb8557e08f76ebfd1b6cb52b16facbd7949","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","span_id":"es3"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es3"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":1},"gap_items":[],"heading":"设计依据","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究采用治疗政策策略作为估计目标框架。主要终点为第8周24小时平均疼痛NRS评分较基线的变化，该终点反映在允许急救用药和自然脱落条件下试验药物的整体治疗效果。研究期间允许受试者按需使用对乙酰氨基酚作为急救镇痛，急救用药不改变受试者的治疗组归属，相关数据纳入主要终点分析。因任何原因脱落或退出研究的受试者不进行替换，其已收集数据按意向性分析原则纳入全分析集。该策略旨在评估KZ-PHN902在真实临床使用情境下的有效性，而非理想化完全依从条件下的疗效。","rationale":"治疗政策策略、主要终点定义、急救对乙酰氨基酚不改变归属、脱落不替换按ITT入FAS均来自当前项目已确认研究事实。'真实临床使用情境'为治疗政策策略的标准解释性表述，需医学经理确认措辞。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点、估计目标）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_a67458cd1359_971df35e6c782845","section_number":"4.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:e7a844fdaed1bdb4491456b3","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_eba001f4710fc0467a56:r6:d6337f3cdaaf17f7","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:97a2bd7fcf7302"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006152112_386da2d3","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"提供KZ-PHN902研究者手册（含非临床药理学、毒理学、PK/PD数据）及既往人体研究数据，以说明100mg和200mg两个剂量水平的选择依据","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_dose_rationale_01","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册","非临床药理学与毒理学数据","既往人体临床研究数据"],"target":"4.2.1 剂量选择依据"},{"action":"提供普瑞巴林活性对照150mg→300mg BID滴定方案的文献依据或既往研究参考","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_dose_rationale_02","missing_source_classes":["活性对照选择依据文献","普瑞巴林PHN适应症临床证据"],"target":"4.2.1 剂量选择依据"}],"heading":"剂量选择依据","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册","非临床药理学与毒理学数据","既往人体临床研究数据","活性对照选择依据文献"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"当前项目已确认KZ-PHN902 100mg/200mg BID及普瑞巴林150mg→300mg BID滴定的剂量方案，但缺少说明这些剂量选择理由的核心来源（IB、非临床数据、既往临床数据）。仅有剂量数值无法构成'剂量选择依据'的实质正文。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（剂量选择依据）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_a67458cd1359_2095604cc7275e36","section_number":"4.2.1","sourc